ct outside healthcare and education.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's tone towards technology in this passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A. Critical and skeptical.\",\n        \"B. Optimistic and hopeful.\",\n        \"C. Neutral, providing only factual information.\",\n        \"D. Prejudiced against technology users.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main purpose of this passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A. To criticize technology's impact on society.\",\n        \"B. To promote a specific startup or product.\",\n        \"C. To highlight the positive effects of innovative technologies.\",\n        \"D. To describe the daily life of entrepreneurs in New York City.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
